          "description": "Pseudo-plastic drag at tauc=1000 Pa, vx=0 m/s, vy=0 m/s: beta = tauc*|v|^(q-1)*u_threshold^(-q), dbeta = (q-1)*beta/|v|^2 with q=0.25, u_threshold=100 m/yr (stage1/dumps/basal_strength/drag_pseudo_plastic.csv).",
          "time_span": { "start": 0.0, "end": 1.0 },
